column51:
Now note may move to the root directory after enabling cron in it. It caused by {{Note#setName}}
{code:java}
  public void setName(String name) {
    this.name = name;
    if (this.path == null) {
      if (name.startsWith("/")) {
        this.path = name;
      } else {
        this.path = "/" + name;
      }
    } else {
      int pos = this.path.indexOf("/");
      this.path = this.path.substring(0, pos + 1) + this.name;
    }
  }
{code}
{{int pos = this.path.indexOf("/");}} should be replaced with {{this.path.lastIndexOf("/")}}

