 Review comment:
   I double checked it in the Slack API documentation and although the text parameter is marked as Required, it is not mandatory if an attachment is defined.
   File upload does not require text parameter either.
   So we can make it optional.

   I this case the following message types would be possible:
   - text only
   - text + attachment
   - attachment only
   - text + file upload (image)
   - file upload (image) only


