 Review comment:
   The latest commit removes the `getSolrClient` method from the `SolrDao` class.  The SolrClient instance is now managed by the `SolrClientFactory` class.  I had to also add a `close` method to close the connection and release the reference so that a new SolrClient can be instantiated as needed.  This was necessary for integration tests because multiple in memory Solr servers are spun up in the same JVM and a new client is needed for each.

