column51:
Hive parse statement incorrectly when there is a semicolon in  a pair of double quote. 

For example:
 The statement:
{code:java}
select * from table_a where column_a not like "%;";{code}
Will be parsed to:
{code:java}
select * from table_a where column_a not like "%{code}

