   This code assumes a certain layout of dump directory i.e. each db level directory will have several table level directories in it and each of those will have _metadata file in it. Repl load code also has code with the same assumption. There might be other places which have similar assumption. If that assumption changes in future, whosoever changes it will need to make sure to change it in both these places. How can we make sure that that person knows about both these places when it comes to that. For example, can we create an iterator which will supply the table level directories and use that iterator at both the places?

