Error: java.io.IOException: org.apache.hadoop.hive.ql.parse.SemanticException: Line 1:7 Invalid table alias or column reference 'non_existing': (possible column names are: c1, c2, c3, c4, c5, c6, c7, c8) (state=,code=0){code}

