+ * This class converts JSON strings into Java or Hive Primitive objects.
+ *
+ * Support types are:<br/>
+ * <br/>
+ * <table border="1">
+ * <tr>
+ * <th>JSON Type</th>
+ * <th>Java Type</th>
+ * <th>Notes</th>
+ * </tr>
+ * <tr>
+ * <td>Object</td>
+ * <td>java.util.List</td>
+ * <td>Each element may be different type
+ * </tr>
+ * <tr>
+ * <td>Array</td>
+ * <td>java.util.List</td>
+ * <td>Each element is same type</td>
+ * </tr>
+ * <tr>
+ * <td>Map</td>
+ * <td>java.util.Map</td>
