 Review comment:
   This won't be thread safe since if there are concurrent calls to pushMessages() some unacknowledged futures may be cleared. `flush` is already removing with `poll`, so I think this can be removed.

   Also, this forces a synchronous wait every 1000 messages. Should there be different max buffer and flush amounts to avoid waiting for the newest messages?

