+    translatorMap.put(PTransformTranslation.READ_TRANSFORM_URN, this::translateRead);
+
     this.urnToTransformTranslator = translatorMap.build();
   }

   @Override
   public Set<String> knownUrns() {
-    return urnToTransformTranslator.keySet();
+    // Do not expose Read as a known URN because we only want to support Read

 Review comment:
   In portable pipelines Reads are executed via an environment, i.e. in the SDK harness via ExecutableStage. So they are not native. If we expose the Read URN here, we will have to deal with translating Python and Java Reads natively. However, we can only translate Java Reads natively.

   Besides the code here being an optimization to execute without the Java SDK harness, we also want to support unbounded reads which are not supported via the SDK harness. 

