 Review comment:
   I think it makes sense to expose this as a general option because many runners will want to do that (and in the same way, via a BeamArtifactsServer), but allow it to be disabled. The goal of this library is to share as much common code as possible, and artifact serving will be common (though possibly not ubiquitous). 

