   @mxm  if there is no option to disable the artifact staging, then basically Samza runner would need to reimplement most of the codes in this file. I see this refactor as a good opportunity to remove much of the duplicate codes between Flink and Samza, and potentially future portable runners.     I agree it isn't super nice to expose this as a general option to users. Alternatively we could abstract this out as a protect method so that we could override the behavior. Either way is fine by me

